{"4273620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Whispers of Appalachia", "steam_appid": 4273620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 Enter a forest you were never meant to leave</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an <strong>atmospheric walking simulator</strong> inspired by dark legends and stories from the <strong>Appalachian Mountains</strong>.<br>You venture deep into a forest where people have disappeared for decades — and where something still lurks among the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero. You have no weapons.<br>You are just another lost soul who stepped too far off the path… and may never return.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273620/extras/173317368fef72bc9a51412d54f3b538.avif?t=1778332765\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Several nights. One goal: survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will spend <strong>multiple nights in the forest</strong>, a place that changes once the sun goes down.<br>During the day, you try to <strong>find a way to safety</strong>, navigate the environment, and move forward.<br>At night, the forest becomes hostile — quiet, dark, and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no puzzles and no objectives</strong> designed to slow you down.<br>You keep walking. You follow the path. You listen to the sounds around you.<br>And you hope that nothing is following you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273620/extras/1da82fb910145232ed4153ceff267ab3.avif?t=1778332765\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>👁️ Monsters, randomness, and hidden details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is not empty.<br>It is home to <strong>several different monsters</strong>, each with its own behavior.<br>Their movement is <strong>random</strong>, meaning <strong>no playthrough is ever the same</strong> — you can never be sure what waits beyond the next tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >move straight through the environment…</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or choose to <strong>explore it more carefully</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some locations hide <strong>easter eggs, environmental details, and subtle hints</strong>, not required to progress, but meant to deepen the atmosphere and suggest what happened to others before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >random encounters with monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>jumpscares</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a small number of <strong>NPCs</strong> you may encounter — or miss entirely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a strong focus on atmosphere, sound design, and tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest chooses its victims.<br>The only question is whether you will become one of them.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 Enter a forest you were never meant to leave</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an <strong>atmospheric walking simulator</strong> inspired by dark legends and stories from the <strong>Appalachian Mountains</strong>.<br>You venture deep into a forest where people have disappeared for decades — and where something still lurks among the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero. You have no weapons.<br>You are just another lost soul who stepped too far off the path… and may never return.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273620/extras/173317368fef72bc9a51412d54f3b538.avif?t=1778332765\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Several nights. One goal: survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will spend <strong>multiple nights in the forest</strong>, a place that changes once the sun goes down.<br>During the day, you try to <strong>find a way to safety</strong>, navigate the environment, and move forward.<br>At night, the forest becomes hostile — quiet, dark, and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no puzzles and no objectives</strong> designed to slow you down.<br>You keep walking. You follow the path. You listen to the sounds around you.<br>And you hope that nothing is following you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273620/extras/1da82fb910145232ed4153ceff267ab3.avif?t=1778332765\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>👁️ Monsters, randomness, and hidden details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is not empty.<br>It is home to <strong>several different monsters</strong>, each with its own behavior.<br>Their movement is <strong>random</strong>, meaning <strong>no playthrough is ever the same</strong> — you can never be sure what waits beyond the next tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >move straight through the environment…</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or choose to <strong>explore it more carefully</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some locations hide <strong>easter eggs, environmental details, and subtle hints</strong>, not required to progress, but meant to deepen the atmosphere and suggest what happened to others before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >random encounters with monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>jumpscares</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a small number of <strong>NPCs</strong> you may encounter — or miss entirely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a strong focus on atmosphere, sound design, and tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest chooses its victims.<br>The only question is whether you will become one of them.</p>", "short_description": "An atmospheric horror walking simulator inspired by Appalachian folklore. Explore a hostile forest, survive multiple nights, and avoid the creatures that roam within. No puzzles. No combat. Just you, the forest, and what hunts inside it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273620/c15e917d2c52bd661f1afb2bba172f15c348b5e6/header.jpg?t=1778332765", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273620/4d6c5801e0706cb84e650798548274679517d528/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778332765", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273620/4d6c5801e0706cb84e650798548274679517d528/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778332765", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon RX 460 (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT (6 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2025 Hidden Frame Interactive. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Hidden Frame Interactive"], "publishers": ["Hidden Frame Interactive"], "pac